# Environment Variable Configuration Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in your project directory: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Uncomment the lines you need and replace the placeholder values.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or any real secrets to Git.
# Everything is optional: without any key, `find`, `inspect`, `related`,
# `brief --no-ai` and the MCP server all work.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- GitHub (optional, recommended) ---
# Raises GitHub's limit from 60 to 5,000 requests/hour, so more issues get checked.
# A fine-grained token with NO extra permissions is enough (public, read-only data).
# GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here

# --- Gemini (optional: Gemini starter briefs, adk web, adk run) ---
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey. GEMINI_API_KEY is also accepted.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# --- Model Settings ---
# ISSUE_SCOUT_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash
